  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dd7c6ffe-6722-4ae5-a7fd-4776084ad1d5"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the matrix of all the effective resistances, in the order of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["VertexList"]], "paclet:ref/VertexList"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
