Cell["\<\
On a graph with several components the pseudoinverse still gives a finite \
number between two components, though no current can flow and the resistance \
is infinite.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3116eb70-dcbc-41f9-9d7d-c3779933bf17"],

